        <div class="case-study-image">
          <div class="image-placeholder"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-study-content">
          <div class="industry-tag">Manufacturing</div>
          <h2>Streamlining Production Tracking for ABC Manufacturing</h2>
          <p>ABC Manufacturing needed a solution to track production across multiple facilities. We developed a custom database application that provided real-time visibility into production status, inventory levels, and quality metrics.</p>
          <h3>Challenges</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Multiple legacy systems with incompatible data formats</li>
            <li>Geographically distributed production facilities</li>
            <li>Need for real-time reporting and analytics</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Solution</h3>
          <p>We created a centralized database system with custom interfaces for each department, automated data migration from legacy systems, and implemented real-time dashboards for management.</p>
          <h3>Results</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>35% reduction in production reporting time</li>
            <li>Improved inventory accuracy from 82% to 99%</li>
            <li>Enabled data-driven decision making across all departments</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-study">
        <div class="case-study-image">
          <div class="image-placeholder"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-study-content">
          <div class="industry-tag">Local Authority</div>
          <h2>Modernizing Citizen Services for Midlands Council</h2>
          <p>Midlands Council needed to replace their outdated citizen service portal with a modern, user-friendly system. We developed a web-based application that integrated with their existing databases while providing an improved experience for both citizens and staff.</p>
          <h3>Challenges</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Legacy system with 15+ years of historical data</li>
            <li>Need for accessibility compliance</li>
            <li>Integration with multiple department systems</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Solution</h3>
          <p>We built a new ASP.NET web application with a responsive design, implemented secure data migration, and created APIs for seamless integration with other council systems.</p>
          <h3>Results</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>50% increase in online service usage by citizens</li>
            <li>Reduced processing time for requests by 40%</li>
            <li>Full WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility compliance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-study">
        <div class="case-study-image">
          <div class="image-placeholder"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-study-content">
          <div class="industry-tag">Financial Services</div>
          <h2>Secure Client Portal for XYZ Financial Advisors</h2>
          <p>XYZ Financial Advisors needed a secure portal for clients to access their financial information and communicate with advisors. We developed a custom solution that met strict security requirements while providing an intuitive user experience.</p>
          <h3>Challenges</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Stringent data security and compliance requirements</li>
            <li>Integration with existing financial management software</li>
            <li>Need for both web and mobile access</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Solution</h3>
          <p>We created a secure client portal with end-to-end encryption, two-factor authentication, and responsive design for all devices. The system integrated seamlessly with their existing financial software.</p>
          <h3>Results</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>100% compliance with financial industry regulations</li>
            <li>75% reduction in paper-based communications</li>
            <li>Improved client satisfaction and retention</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
